{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测 GDB 附加并挂钩其他进程。对应需求：调试器窃密。","from":"now-9m","index":["auditbeat-*","endgame-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux用GDB挂钩进程","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\ngdb -p 附加到非调试场景进程。\n\n### 为何重要\n可注入或读取目标进程内存。\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与时间是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://github.com/controlplaneio/truffleproc","https://github.com/hajzer/bash-memory-dump"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"66c058f3-99f4-4d18-952b-43348f2577a0","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 凭据访问","来源: 默认","对应需求: 进程挂钩"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action in (\"exec\", \"exec_event\", \"start\", \"ProcessRollup2\", \"executed\", \"process_started\")\n and process.name == \"gdb\" and process.args in (\"--pid\", \"-p\") and\n/* Covered by d4ff2f53-c802-4d2e-9fb9-9ecc08356c3f */\nprocess.args != \"1\"\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1003","name":"OS Credential Dumping","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1003.007","name":"Proc Filesystem","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1003/007/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0006","name":"Credential Access","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0006/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1055","name":"Process Injection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1055.008","name":"Ptrace System Calls","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/008/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（需要进程/网络/文件事件，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":109,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
